message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the exploratory v0.4 release."
title: "PaperEdits Gemini Agentic Video Understanding Benchmark"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "PaperEdits"
version: "0.4-exploratory"
date-released: 2026-09-02
url: "https://paperedits.com/benchmarking/gemini-agentic-video-understanding-benchmark"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sarvob/gemini-agentic-video-benchmark"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - video understanding
  - agentic AI
  - benchmark
  - video editing
abstract: >-
  An exploratory benchmark comparing Gemini 3.7 Flash agentic and static
  video-understanding modes across six synthetic 10-minute fixtures. Five
  fixtures produced valid paired results. The release includes frozen prompts,
  ground truth, deterministic scorers, result artifacts, limitations, and a
  zero-cost public verification path. It does not establish statistical
  significance or compare Gemini with PaperEdits.
